  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ ABOUT TEASER + CONTACT ============ -->
<section class="wrap" id="about" style="padding:clamp(64px,10vw,110px) 0 clamp(48px,7vw,72px)">
  <div class="about-grid" style="padding-inline:var(--gut)">
    <div class="statement reveal">My work is grounded in <span class="em">clarity</span>, shaped by <span class="em">curiosity</span>, and driven by the <span class="em">why</span> behind what we build.</div>
    <div class="body-copy reveal">
      <p>I grew up in Houston and earned a B.S. in Industrial Design from the University of Houston, with a minor in Architecture. I started in physical product — housewares, exhibits, prototypes — before moving into digital product and UX.</p>
      <p>When I'm not designing, you'll usually find me working on cars — fixing anything from a flat tire to a blown piston.</p>
      <a class="back" href="/about.html" style="color:var(--accent);font-weight:600">More about me →</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

